#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:650
msgid "Better error handling for network timeouts"
msgstr "ለአውታረ መረብ ጊዜ ማብቂያዎች የተሻለ የስህተት አያያዝ"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:651
msgid "Enhanced stability for extended usage"
msgstr "ለረዘመ አጠቃቀም የተሻሻለ መረጋጋት"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:652
msgid "Performance optimizations for scrolling"
msgstr "ለማሸብለል የአፈጻጸም ማመቻቸቶች"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:658
msgid "🔧 Metadata and Standards Compliance"
msgstr "🔧 የሜታዳታ እና የደረጃዎች ተኳኋኝነት"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:661
msgid "Fixed duplicate provides tags in metainfo validation"
msgstr "በ metainfo ማረጋገጫ ውስጥ ተባዥ የ provides ታጎች ተስተካክለዋል"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:662
msgid "Corrected AppStream metainfo format compliance"
msgstr "የ AppStream metainfo ቅርጸት ተኳኋኝነት ተስተካክሏል"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:663
msgid "Resolved invalid markup in release descriptions"
msgstr "በልቀት መግለጫዎች ውስጥ ልክ ያልሆነ markup ተፈትቷል"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:667
msgid "Updated all references from appdata to metainfo format"
msgstr "ሁሉም ማጣቀሻዎች ከ appdata ወደ metainfo ቅርጸት ተዘምነዋል"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:668
msgid "Enhanced Flathub compliance and validation"
msgstr "የ Flathub ተኳኋኝነት እና ማረጋገጫ ተሻሽሏል"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:669
msgid "Improved translation file consistency"
msgstr "የትርጉም ፋይል ወጥነት ተሻሽሏል"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:678
msgid "Fixed crash when handling invalid notification data"
msgstr "ልክ ያልሆነ የማሳወቂያ ውሂብ ሲያስተናግድ የነበረ ብልሽት ተስተካክሏል"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:679
msgid "Resolved memory leak in WebKit manager cleanup"
msgstr "በ WebKit አስተዳዳሪ ማጽዳት ውስጥ የማስታወሻ ፍሳሽ ተፈትቷል"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:680
msgid "Corrected window state persistence on shutdown"
msgstr "በመዘጋት ጊዜ የመስኮት ሁኔታ ጽናት ተስተካክሏል"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:684
msgid "Better error handling for network disconnections"
msgstr "ለአውታረ መረብ መቋረጦች የተሻለ የስህተት አያያዝ"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:685
msgid "Enhanced stability during long sessions"
msgstr "በረዥም ክፍለ ጊዜዎች ጊዜ የተሻሻለ መረጋጋት"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:686
msgid "Performance optimizations for faster startup"
msgstr "ለፈጣን ጅማሬ የአፈጻጸም ማመቻቸቶች"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:692
msgid "🚀 Major Architecture Migration: Python to Vala/GTK4"
msgstr "🚀 ዋና የአርክቴክቸር ፍልሰት፦ ከ Python ወደ Vala/GTK4"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:693
msgid ""
"BREAKING CHANGE: Complete rewrite from Python to native Vala for better "
"performance and integration."
msgstr "ሰባሪ ለውጥ፦ ለተሻለ አፈጻጸም እና ውህደት ከ Python ወደ ቤተኛ Vala ሙሉ ድጋሚ መጻፍ።"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:694
msgid ""
"⚠️ Important: After upgrading, you will need to re-sync your mobile device "
"with WhatsApp Web as this is a completely new application implementation."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ አስፈላጊ፦ ይህ ሙሉ በሙሉ አዲስ የመተግበሪያ ትግበራ ስለሆነ ከማሻሻል በኋላ የተንቀሳቃሽ መሣሪያዎን ከ "
"WhatsApp Web ጋር እንደገና ማመሳሰል ያስፈልግዎታል።"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:697
msgid "Native Vala/GTK4 implementation for optimal performance"
msgstr "ለተመቻቸ አፈጻጸም ቤተኛ የ Vala/GTK4 ትግበራ"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:698
msgid "Modern LibAdwaita UI with Blueprint declarative interface"
msgstr "ከ Blueprint መግለጫ በይነገጽ ጋር ዘመናዊ LibAdwaita UI"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:699
msgid "Enhanced WebKitGTK 6.0 integration"
msgstr "የተሻሻለ WebKitGTK 6.0 ውህደት"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:700
msgid "Advanced notification system with native desktop integration"
msgstr "ከቤተኛ የዴስክቶፕ ውህደት ጋር የላቀ የማሳወቂያ ሥርዓት"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:701
msgid "Comprehensive accessibility support"
msgstr "ሁሉን አቀፍ የተደራሽነት ድጋፍ"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:702
msgid "Professional logging and crash reporting system"
msgstr "ሙያዊ የመዝገብ መያዝ እና የብልሽት ሪፖርት ሥርዓት"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:704
msgid "Multi-language spell checking support"
msgstr "ባለብዙ-ቋንቋ የፊደል ማረጋገጫ ድጋፍ"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:705
msgid "Granular privacy and notification controls"
msgstr "ጥቃቅን የግላዊነት እና የማሳወቂያ መቆጣጠሪያዎች"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:706
msgid "Hardware-accelerated rendering"
msgstr "በሃርድዌር-የተፋጠነ ማቅረቢያ"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:707
msgid "Improved memory efficiency and startup performance"
msgstr "የተሻሻለ የማስታወሻ ቅልጥፍና እና የጅማሬ አፈጻጸም"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:709
msgid "Technical Improvements:"
msgstr "ቴክኒካዊ ማሻሻያዎች፦"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:711
msgid "Migrated from Python 3 to native Vala compilation"
msgstr "ከ Python 3 ወደ ቤተኛ Vala ኮምፓይሊንግ ተሰደደ"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:712
msgid "Modern Meson build system with Blueprint UI compilation"
msgstr "ከ Blueprint UI ኮምፓይሊንግ ጋር ዘመናዊ Meson የግንባታ ሥርዓት"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:713
msgid "Comprehensive test suite with unit and integration tests"
msgstr "ከክፍል እና ከውህደት ሙከራዎች ጋር ሁሉን አቀፍ የሙከራ ስብስብ"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:714
msgid "Production-ready error handling and crash recovery"
msgstr "ለምርት ዝግጁ የስህተት አያያዝ እና የብልሽት ማገገም"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:715
msgid "Enhanced security with proper sandboxing"
msgstr "ከተገቢ sandboxing ጋር የተሻሻለ ደህንነት"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:716
msgid "Complete internationalization support"
msgstr "ሙሉ የዓለም አቀፍ ድጋፍ"

